<title>USA: Chateau Properties holders approve merger.</title>
<headline>Chateau Properties holders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chateau Properties Inc said Tuesday its shareholders approved a proposed merger with ROC Communities Inc.</p>
<p>At a special meeting of shareholders, Chateau officials said about 85 percent of the shares voted were in favor of the deal.  </p>
<p>Late last month, ROC shareholders approved the merger with Chateau.</p>
<p>Chateau was the target of a $26 a share takeover by Manufactured Home Communities Inc. That offer had been rejected by Chateau as it continued with its proposed merger with ROC.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
